### ========== 1. 注册新用户（旧用户密码加密器不兼容，必须重新注册） ==========
POST http://localhost:8080/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "wangwu",
  "password": "123456",
  "nickname": "王五"
}

### ========== 2. 登录（返回 JWT Token） ==========
POST http://localhost:8080/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "wangwu",
  "password": "123456"
}

### ========== 3. 获取当前登录用户信息（需 Token） ==========
GET http://localhost:8080/me
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzM4NCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiI1IiwidXNlcm5hbWUiOiJ3YW5nd3UiLCJpYXQiOjE3ODY2MzAxNjYsImV4cCI6MTc4NzIzNDk2Nn0.mv-a6RlG1CX3B82iMCPfC4DEx54mUOZw7E7ew0cDa0ss-li4V8sIU0NOEk0vUSRE

### ========== 4. 发布文章（需 Token，不需要 userId） ==========
POST http://localhost:8080/api/articles/publish?title=Day06测试&content=JWT登录鉴权搞定啦
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzM4NCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiI1IiwidXNlcm5hbWUiOiJ3YW5nd3UiLCJpYXQiOjE3ODY2MzAxNjYsImV4cCI6MTc4NzIzNDk2Nn0.mv-a6RlG1CX3B82iMCPfC4DEx54mUOZw7E7ew0cDa0ss-li4V8sIU0NOEk0vUSRE

### ========== 5. 文章列表（不需要 Token，白名单放行） ==========
GET http://localhost:8080/api/articles

### ========== 6. 文章详情（不需要 Token，白名单放行） ==========
GET http://localhost:8080/api/articles/detail/2

### ========== 7. 发表评论（需 Token，不需要 userId） ==========
POST http://localhost:8080/api/comments
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzM4NCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiI1IiwidXNlcm5hbWUiOiJ3YW5nd3UiLCJpYXQiOjE3ODY2MzAxNjYsImV4cCI6MTc4NzIzNDk2Nn0.mv-a6RlG1CX3B82iMCPfC4DEx54mUOZw7E7ew0cDa0ss-li4V8sIU0NOEk0vUSRE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "articleId": 1,
  "content": "这篇文章写得真好！"
}

### ========== 8. 查询某篇文章的评论（不需要 Token） ==========
GET http://localhost:8080/api/comments/article/1

### ========== 9. 删除评论（需 Token） ==========
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/comments/2
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzM4NCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiI1IiwidXNlcm5hbWUiOiJ3YW5nd3UiLCJpYXQiOjE3ODY2MzAxNjYsImV4cCI6MTc4NzIzNDk2Nn0.mv-a6RlG1CX3B82iMCPfC4DEx54mUOZw7E7ew0cDa0ss-li4V8sIU0NOEk0vUSRE

### ========== 10. 不登录发布文章（应该返回 401） ==========
POST http://localhost:8080/api/articles/publish?title=黑客入侵&content=没登录就想发文章